  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\n- An indexer getter setup is registered once under contention (#411, closes #398). Configuring the same getter builder from several threads at once could register a second, unconfigured setup alongside the configured one, and calls could reach it. Each getter builder now has exactly one setup.\n\nPerformance\n\n- Count.Never(), Once(), Twice(), AtLeastOnce() and AtMostOnce() no longer allocate (#412, closes #400). Each returns one cached instance. Count is immutable and compares by value, so only reference equality between two calls changes.\n\nMaintenance\n\n- Tests that blocked thread-pool threads now run their workers on dedicated threads, so CI no longer fails intermittently on 2-core runners (#415, closes #414).\n- GitHub Actions dependencies updated (#410).",
